description:
St Basils is seeking a consultancy partner, or partners, to deliver a series of defined ICT consultancy work packages.
The overall objectives of this procurement are to:
• improve St Basils' understanding of its current ICT environment;
• optimise use of existing Microsoft and related technologies;
• strengthen infrastructure and cyber resilience;
• support a more effective use of SharePoint, Intune and Power BI;
• establish a clearer roadmap towards improved governance and ISO 27001 readiness;
